The profile catalog (releases/ and the generated data/) is derived from preset
data published by each supported printer vendor's own OrcaSlicer-family fork,
today Snapmaker Orca (github.com/Snapmaker/OrcaSlicer), which is
AGPL-3.0-or-later. That provenance is why this package is AGPL-3.0-or-later.
data/index.json names the upstream releases the catalog holds.

The PrusaSlicer presets (sources/ and data/sources/prusaslicer/) are Prusa
Research's print presets as PrusaSlicer ships them, from the vendor bundle in
PrusaSlicer's own repository (github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer,
resources/profiles/PrusaResearch.ini) at each release tag, with that release's
built-in defaults from its source (src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp). PrusaSlicer
is AGPL-3.0-or-later. Each file names its release tag and commit, and
data/index.json lists them under "sources".

